      en: ["Giant bronze sculpture located behind the San Felipe de Barajas fortress.", "A tribute to the Cartagenero poet Luis Carlos López (1883-1950).", "Inspired by the last lines of the poem 'A mi Ciudad Nativa'.", "The current sculpture is a 1994 replica of the 1957 original.", "One of the most photographed and interactive public artworks in Colombia."]
