      en: ["A massive monolith rising 220 meters from the ground.", "Requires climbing 740 steps to reach the observation deck at the top.", "The rock is estimated to be over 70 million years old.", "Offers a breathtaking 360-degree view of the Guatapé reservoir.", "Declared a National Monument by the Colombian government in the 1940s."]
