      hu: ["Gazdag történelmi háttérrel rendelkezik.", "Kulturálisan meghatározó jelentőségű a régióban.", "Egyedülálló turisztikai és kutatási célpont."],
      ro: ["Un element istoric cheie pentru Landmarks 10.", "O atracție culturală remarcabilă în zona Landmarks 10."],
      en: ["Stands 26 meters tall on top of the 1,440-meter Cerro de los Cristales.", "Inaugurated in 1953 to commemorate the end of the Thousand Days' War.", "Sculpted by Alideo Tazzioli, an Italian artist based in Cali.", "The statue weighs approximately 464 tons.", "The access road features large-scale clay sculptures known as the 'Geo-glyphs'."]
