      en: ["Site of the decisive Battle of Boyacá on August 7, 1819.", "The park features the 'Monumento a Bolívar', created by German sculptor Von Miller.", "Includes an eternal flame that honors the fallen heroes of independence.", "Declared a National Monument and a sacred site of Colombian history.", "The entire complex is a masterpiece of early 20th-century commemorative art."]
