      en: ["The fourth cathedral built on this site, with the current one dating to 1823.", "A masterpiece of the Spanish architect Fray Domingo de Petrés.", "Contains the tomb of Gonzalo Jiménez de Quesada, the founder of Bogotá.", "Designated as a National Monument of Colombia in 1975.", "Located on the site of the very first mass ever celebrated in Bogotá in 1538."]
